cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CDFD Runtime, cite this software release and cite the Part I and Part II CDFD archives when their framework or examples are part of your work."
title: "CDFD Runtime: Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics and CDFL Execution Engine"
version: "1.1.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20343160
date-released: 2026-06-06
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
